    <item>
      <title>GoPro 以 2.85 亿美元现金出让控制权，Starman 接手运动相机鼻祖</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260901/GoPro-%E4%BB%A5-2.85-%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E7%8E%B0%E9%87%91%E5%87%BA%E8%AE%A9%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%9D%83Starman-%E6%8E%A5%E6%89%8B%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E7%9B%B8%E6%9C%BA%E9%BC%BB%E7%A5%96/</link>
